===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/iː/|lang=is}}
*: {{rhymes|iː|lang=is}}

===Preposition===
{{head|is|preposition}}

# {{lb|is|with accusative}} [[in]]; [[to]] (direction)
#: {{ux|is|Ég geng '''í''' kirkjuna''|I walk '''to''' the church|inline=1}}
# {{lb|is|with dative}} [[in]] (location)
#: {{ux|is|Hann er '''í''' húsinu''|He is '''in''' the house|inline=1}}
# {{lb|is|with accusative}} [[for]]; [[over]] (spanning a time period)
#: {{ux|is|Við ókum '''í''' tvær klukkustundir''|We drove '''for''' two hours|inline=1}}

